    "sections": {
        "description": "The HVAC Repair theme provides a structured and responsive layout designed for presenting service information, company details, contact options, and project-related content. It includes customizable homepage sections, service blocks, banner areas, and navigation menus that help organize information in a clear and accessible format. Built-in customization settings allow adjustments to colors, typography, page layouts, and content arrangements without modifying core files. Additional features include blog integration, image galleries, contact form compatibility, social media links, and widget-ready areas that support expanded functionality. Multiple page templates allow content such as service descriptions, maintenance information, project showcases, and company updates to be arranged efficiently. The responsive design adapts to desktops, tablets, and smartphones, helping maintain usability across various screen sizes. Search functionality and customizable footer sections further improve content accessibility. The layout emphasizes readability, organized spacing, and straightforward navigation to support clear content presentation. Compatibility with modern browsers and commonly used plugins provides flexibility for extending functionality when required. Overall, the theme offers a practical framework for displaying repair, informational content, and updates while maintaining a consistent and responsive website structure."
    },
